  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="42dc9128-186c-5906-8c84-938c98e59bca" activityNameId="13b24785-3279-59d2-851c-cb47e5afd690" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, biogas combustion, in cogen 200kWe lean burn</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, biogas combustion, in cogen 200kWe lean burn
This dataset needs to be combined with the datasets for the biogas input and the infrastrucure expenditures in order to establish the multi-output process which provides the products electricity and heat from cogeneration.;
UUID: 71edccde-5498-3a98-8c40-5b9988cb32de
Use of biogas in a cogeneration unit. Included are emissions to air, as well as use and disposal of operational supplements. Excluded are the biogas consumption and infrastructure expenditures.
Location: Biogas input modelled for conditions in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Radial turbine with recuperation for preheating the compressed air and fuel gas booster to increase gas pressure. Operation with refined biogas from low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 29%, total efficiency 75%. Operation as base load engine with low partial load hours.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_71edccde-5498-3a98-8c40-5b9988cb32de.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
